;; The words /drive puts together (RFC-073 "The drive loop", byj-71w.6):
;; the brief each bead's turn is asked, and what drive$check and the report
;; say. brainyard.drive fills {name} from the bead and the profile; what a
;; model reads is here, not in src/.
{:brief "Work on bead {id}: {title}\n\n{description}\n\nThis is one step of /drive, toward this project's goal{goal}. Do this bead's work and check it as the project's instructions say: run its tests, keep to its decisions and rules. AGENTS.md's profile says what you do on your own here and what the person decides: keep to it. Where it says to ask before a commit, a bead filed or closed, a decision record or a push, run the command or write the file — byj asks the person then and waits for their answer. Put a question in your answer only for a change of goal, scope, stack or done criteria, or a decision the profile does not let you make. End by saying what you did, how you checked it, and anything left."

 :retry "Bead {id} ({title}) is not finished: {why}\n\nFinish it: do what is missing, check it, and keep to AGENTS.md's profile as before. End by saying what you did and how you checked it."

 :ask-work "/drive: work on {id} ({title}) next?"
 :ask-close "/drive: close {id} ({title}) — {summary}?"

 ;; what the profile expects of a finished bead, for drive/judge
 :expect {:git/commit {:act "the profile has an agent commit its own work: a finished bead leaves its work committed, the work tree clean"
                       :ask "the profile has the person decide each commit: a finished bead's turn runs git commit for its work, and byj asks the person then; its work is left uncommitted only when the person said no to that commit"
                       :never "the profile has no agent commit: uncommitted work is expected"}}

 :stops {:no-profile "This project has no profile: /init drafts one when you tell it what the project is for."
         :no-bd "bd is not installed, or beads is not set up here: /drive works through beads."
         :nothing-ready "Nothing is ready{under}: every bead toward the goal is done, blocked or claimed."
         :work-never "The profile has no agent pick its own work (:issue/work :never)."
         :work-declined "You did not want {id} worked on next."
         :failures "{n} attempts in a row did not finish a bead: the profile's limit."
         :usd "${n} spent: the profile's limit."
         :issues "{n} beads filed in this run: the profile's limit."
         :steps "The run's step limit ({n}) was reached."}}
